window.products.push({"id":188221,"name":"Ultimate Comfort with Superior 700 Fill Power Hungarian White Goose Down Pillow - Luxury Hotel Pillows, 100% Cotton Striped Damask Shell - Standard Si","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+QLrmOVtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Real Sleep SolutionEvery night of sleep brings you challenges—you can't get comfortable, your neck aches, it's hard to breathe, or you sweat too much. You need a goose down, standard-sized pillow 2 pack from Continental Bedding! Your pillows are hypoallergenic, soft yet supportive, and breathable, ensuring excellent comfort through the night. Enjoy plush, 700-fill-power density that's sure to maintain its cushioning power for years.Down Is DifferentFind out what down, the softest plumage, can do for your comfort and overall health. This unique material is soft, shapeable, and easy to re-fluff. Your down pillows are inherently hypoallergenic and double-sealed to keep all the stuffing in, unlike lower-quality feather pillows. Rest your head on a striped damask cotton pillow shell that's cool, gentle, and breathable on your skin.Resist Temptation, Choose ExcellenceWhy steal a hotel pillow? Maybe you don't know that you don't need to, or maybe you're mad at the concierge. But you can have even better pillows that no one else has slept on! Indulge yourself with extra soft pillows for sleeping in pampered luxury, without racking up extra hotel charges.No Corners CutSleep on luxury pillows that you can feel good about owning. Your down pillows are proudly made in the USA with premium-quality Hungarian goose down that's RDS-certified to be a cruelty-free material. That means no force feeding, no live plucking, and no inhumane farming practices.A Legacy of LuxuryLet Continental Bedding show you the modern down pillow standard. We're trusted bedding experts with over 90 years of experience, beginning in a small shop in Hungary and progressing to our present headquarters in the Brooklyn borough of New York City. However you sleep, whatever you need, we're here to help with world-class pillows.Learn the meaning of sleep with Continental Bedding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+QLrmOVtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Continental Bedding","source_asin":"B07J2922RD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-188221","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J2922RD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J2922RD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
