window.products.push({"id":188377,"name":"LEM Products 1387 MaxVac Vacuum Sealer Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IbROF1KZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We designed our vacuum bags to achieve the professional results hunters and master chefs demand. Our innovative parallel channel design prevents hidden air pockets while the sturdy 3.5 mil puncture resistant plastic makes these bags ideal for the big jobs. All bags are reusable, include a space to label the date/contents and are compatible with major vacuum sealer brands. The bags have an easy open tear notch. Pack a season's worth of Salmon, use for Sous Vide cooking, even keep your camera dry. These bags are up to the task - and all at a price that makes sense! Engineered to achieve optimal results with the LEM MaxVac Sealer. Not compatible with chamber vacuum sealers. LEM Products makes home meat processing easy! We deliver high quality meat processing equipment: meat grinders, jerky making equipment, and vacuum sealers along with the needed supplies for the hunter and home meat processor. Our products allow everyone from butchers, restaurants, and the at-home meat processor to make delicious sausage, jerky and other meat products, all while controlling the healthy content of the foods they provide for their family and friends. LEM is the leader in game processing. We research what our consumers need and translate that into products that help hunters save time and money by turning their hard-earned game into the purest organic meat that can be found. Whether you need a meat grinder, sausage stuffing machine, dehydrator, deli meat slicer, freezer storage solutions, food storage, casings, or seasoning, we will deliver it in a high-quality way. Our goal is to deliver high quality products that make food preparation easy and fun. We will support our customers with end-to-end service and guaranteed satisfaction. We believe home processing to be an essential part of the outdoor experience and will continue to promote the responsible use of our greatest gift, the bountiful outdoors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IbROF1KZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEM","source_asin":"B0C3Y24HMZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-188377","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3Y24HMZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3Y24HMZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
