window.products.push({"id":188455,"name":"Disposable Foil Candle Holders - Heavy Duty Aluminum Protector Bobeches, Drip Guard Candlestick Liner Inserts - 50 Count - by Ner Mitzvah","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91e+CztNAdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KINDLE FLAMES WITHOUT THE FUSS Love to light candles but dread the melted wax mess that ensues? These Disposable Candle Holders by Ner Mtzvah are the solution you wish you knew about ages ago. Our heavy duty aluminum foil drip protectors fit easily in your candlesticks while holding your tapers securely in place. Catching and containing the drips of wax as your candles melt, our bobeche inserts shield your precious candlesticks from wax residue while making cleanup a breeze. After candles have burned out, simply remove from holder and toss! No more digging wax out of ornate carvings or using up all the silver polish to restore your prized candle holders. PRODUCT FEATURES: Heavy Duty Aluminum Foil Diameter: 2.5” top, 11/16” Candle Holder Flexible to Fit your Candle Protects from Wax Drippings 50 Count per Box MULTIPURPOSE, PRACTICAL PROTECTION Whichever type of candle you kindle, these Disposable Candle Holders by Ner Mitzvah are sure to come in handy. Practical and convenient, they will save you time and energy while making cleanup a breeze! Use them for religious, celebratory, outdoor, or emergency purposes alike: - Shabbos & Yom Tov Candlesticks- Church & Baptism Ceremonies- Candlelight Vigils- Advent Wreath- Legion of Mary Meetings- Chandeliers & Candelabras- Chanuka Menorah- Kwanzaa Candles- Decorative Centerpiece for Weddings- Hold Emergency Candles in Power Outage- Restaurants & Cafes- Spas & Yoga Studios- Outdoor Camping Trips Try these Disposable Candle Holders today and let Ner Mitzvah light up your life!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91e+CztNAdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ner Mitzvah","source_asin":"B0BYFV7H2D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-188455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYFV7H2D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYFV7H2D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":188456,"name":"ComForSelf Extra Soft Bathroom Mat 16\"x24\" Grey Memory Foam Bath Mat Non-Slip Bathroom Rug (Grey)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.7,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZYQWSBD+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size: 16 x 24 inches / 40 x 60 cm Color: Gray THIS IS THE BEST BATH MAT IN YOUR LIFE! AND IT IS TRUE! IF NOT, WE WILL REFUND YOUR MONEY! PREMIUM QUALITY FOR ANY BATHROOM The bathroom mat is made with the best memory foam and top with a premium cozy microfiber material. This is very soft, comfortable, relieves stress and tired feet.  ComForSelf covers will provide you comfort and safety from slipping in any room at home! Just make sure the floors are dry before laying down the mat.  If you have a cold floor at home, put the memory foam bath mat on it when busy with your daily routines to warm your feet. ULTRA ABSORBENT In addition, the ultra-soft anti-slip foam bath mat has super absorbency and dries quickly, making it a great choice for everyday use. SIMPLE AND STYLISH Neutral color and simple shape will allow you to use this nonslip plush rug in any space, such as a bathroom, toilet, kitchen, next to the shower, in the bath tub side, study room, nursery, sitting room, at the door etc. EASY TO CLEAN The mat is easy to clean and wash. You can use machine or hand-wash at a water temperature of 30 C. Use a mild detergent without chlorine or bleach. Tumble dry on low or air dry. To freshen this bathfloor rug, you can also just pick it up and shake it. Follow care recommendations and the mat will look like new.  Does not deform after washing!!! ADDITIONAL INFORMATION Please, protect yourself from buying the wrong size.  Before buying our mat, choose the size of the room in which you plan to place this mat, and compare with the actual size of the mat.  ComForSelf memory foam mat is a great gift for yourself or your loved ones! If you still have questions, contact us through Amazon.com.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZYQWSBD+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ComForSelf","source_asin":"B07WW58M3P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-188456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WW58M3P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WW58M3P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
