window.products.push({"id":188548,"name":"Impeccable Bedding Wrap Around Bed Skirts Elastic Dust Ruffles,Easy Fit Wrinkle and Fade Resistant Silky Luxrious Fabric Solid Color,Light Grey Bedski","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B+Ssbl6ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our new wrap-around design bed skirt allows easy install and removal. You no longer need to lift the heavy mattress to put on-off the bed skirts. New and improve design with heavy duty 3 inch thick elastic band to tightly hug the entire circumference of your box spring. The skirt itself covers 3 sides, left, right, and front. The back side is exposed. Applicable Size: (approx.)We offer our bed skirts in four sizes for the perfect fit. Choose from Twin (39\"x75\"), Full (54\"x75\"), Queen (60\"x80\"), King (78\"x80\") [Stylish and Clean Look] - With its featured 12 to 21-inch ruffled drop, Bedskirts give a stylish, elegant and romantic appearance to your bedroom and can also conceal any unsightly frames, box springs, platforms, mattresses or underneath storage. [Fantastic Design] - Designed with adjustable elastic trimmed ruffle, it is so easy to put on and take off the bed skirts that you won't even need to lift the mattress, making it simple to quickly update your room. [Superior Fabric] - 100% Polyester fine texture and nice stitches make our Ruffle bed skirts durable, wrinkle resistant, colorfast and shrink-proof. Also it is breathable, harmless and skin-friendly. [Multiple Sizes and Colors] - These versatile bed skirts are available in multiple sizes and an array of colors, satisfying different sizes of mattress and to suit for all kinds of decoration styles [Easy Care] - This sheet is fade, stain, shrink and wrinkle resistant, so it is machine washable [Tips] - We recommend machine wash in gentle circle. Tumble dry low. Do not bleach. Low ironing. Notice: Because of the different light and different computer screen resolution, the color showed on the screen may be slightly different from the actual one.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B+Ssbl6ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shreem Linen","source_asin":"B08S3YHGTL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-188548","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S3YHGTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S3YHGTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
