window.products.push({"id":188633,"name":"PureFit Set of 4 Curtain Panels - Mix and Match Sheer White Curtains & Blackout Curtains for Bedroom and Living Room, Thermal Insulated Room Darkening","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.72,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l9RRQsSQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PACKAGE CONTENT & PRODUCT DIMENSIONS: Each package includes 2 pieces sheer curtains and 2 pieces blackout curtains. Each curtain panel measures 42\" width by 84\" length. The curtains are constructed with silver rust-proof grommets with inner diameter of 1.6\". MATCH IT, MIX IT & HANG IT AS YOU LIKE: Featuring multiple hanging possibilities, our 4-curtain panel set will unleash the creativity in you to offer a unique style you have created. Solid colors make them easy to match with other curtains you might already have or hang alone for a simple yet elegant look for any room. CURTAINS THAT BLOCK OUT LIGHT: These sun light blocking curtains are built with a triple weave blackout polyester. The back and the front of the curtain feature the same color and are interwoven with a black yarn to enhances the blackout performance by blocking UV rays and completely darkening your spaces. ENERGY SAVING BARRIER & NOISE REDUCING CURTAINS: Our curtains consist of multiple interwoven fabric layers acting as a thermal barrier by protecting against heat during summer and cold during winter. They also absorb noise thanks to their thickness and provides total privacy so your private moments stay private. SIMPLE FABRIC CARE: These curtains are machine washable with cold water, (color fade resistant and wrinkle resistant) tumble dry on low, iron at low temperature if need. Perfect room darkening curtains for living room, bedroom, office, kids and guest rooms.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l9RRQsSQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PureFit","source_asin":"B09DK8HMQZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-188633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DK8HMQZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DK8HMQZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
