window.products.push({"id":188681,"name":"Beauoop Blue Gray Cafe Tier Curtains for Kitchen Leaf Floral Pattern Farmhouse Half Window Curtain Panels for Living Room Bathroom Basement Rod Pocket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Oal7GIswL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PACKAGE CONTENTS: 2 panels yellow and gray blossom leaf print on white canvas valance curtain in each package. 28\" W x 24\" L| Rod Pocket ❀PREMIUM MATERIAL: The floral print curtains are woven from a soft textured and lightweight canvas fabric, which is thick and durable. With good maintenance, the curtains drape well and have an elegant look. The workmanship is exquisite and the print on it is environmental-friendly and safe with the digital print technology. ❀BOTANICAL DESIGN: Delicate floral leaf pattern on white canvas curtains decorate your room with a natural, dynamic and graceful style. The classic design gives the window a refreshed and vivid look, upgrading your home decor. Perfect for kitchen, bathroom, café windows, basement, laundry room. dining room, kitchen, farmhouse and more. ❀LIGHT REDUCING: Our leaves valance curtains allow just enough natural light to get through the window while still provide a degree of privacy for you. It's the ideal option between blackout curtains and transparent sheers. Hanging our curtains, add a refreshing charm and airy feel to your room. ❀CARE INSTRUCTION: Machine washable in cold water, don't bleach, gentle cycle, tumble dry low. Light iron if needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Oal7GIswL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beauoop","source_asin":"B092V6SVF6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-188681","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092V6SVF6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092V6SVF6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
