window.products.push({"id":188861,"name":"Feit Electric Conserv-Energy Dimmable BR40 LED 19 Watt Flood Light Bulb - 100 Watt Equivalent Replacement","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g6UGZp7lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made by one of the highest quality light manufacturers in the world! Light Emitting Diodes, or LEDs, are tiny solid-state light sources that create light without using a filament. They are more efficient than any other lighting technology available today, including halogen, CFL and incandescent. LEDs also outlast each of these technologies. They maintain brightness for up to 25,000 hours or more.  This BR40 flood light delivers exceptionally long life, significant energy savings, beautiful light and contains no mercury.Use them in living rooms, dining rooms and kitchens within your recessed cans and track light fixtures. Advantages of LED Technology 1. Up to 90% more efficient than Incandescent and Halogen 2. Last up to 25,000 Hours - Environmentally Friendly (Mercury Free) 3. Solid state technology withstands shock and vibration 4. Relatively cool running (less energy lost as heat) 5. Lights up instantly 6. Immediate full brightness, 7. No UV Emissions/ no infrared 8. Capable of rapid cycling (unaffected by frequent on/off switching)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g6UGZp7lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Feit Electric","source_asin":"B00LGYBH6K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-188861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LGYBH6K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LGYBH6K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
